  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>{{<small>&#160;</small><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Template_substitution\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Template substitution\">subst</a><code>:</code><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Tsetl</strong><small>&#160;</small>}}<br />&#160;<span class=\"plainlinksneverexpand\"><small><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://second-renaissance.fandom.com/wiki/Special:Whatlinkshere/Template:Tsetl?limit=500\">links</a>&#160;<span class=\"new\" title=\"Template talk:Tsetl (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGVfdGFsazpUc2V0bD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">talk</span>&#160;<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://second-renaissance.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Tsetl?action=edit\">view</a></small></span>\n</p>\n<div id=\"template-documentation\" class=\"template-documentation iezoomfix\">\n<div style=\"padding-bottom:3px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bottom:1ex\">\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:125%\"><span typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Test_Template_Info-Icon_-_Version_(2).svg\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Test Template Info-Icon - Version (2).svg\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"50\">Documentation icon</span></a></span> Template documentation</span></div>\n<p>Like <span style=\"padding-right:3px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Tlx\" title=\"Template:Tlx\">Template:Tlx</a></span><span class=\"plainlinks nourlexpansion lx\" style=\"font-size: 85%;\">(<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://second-renaissance.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Tlx?action=edit\">edit</a>&#160;<span class=\"new\" title=\"Template talk:Tlx (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGVfdGFsazpUbHg/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">talk</span>&#160;<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://second-renaissance.fandom.com/wiki/Special:Whatlinkshere/Template:tlx?limit=500\">links</a>&#160;<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://second-renaissance.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Tlx?action=history\">history</a>)</span> and <code>{{<span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Tlsp (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6VGxzcD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">tlsp</span>}}</code> for up to three parameters, used in template lists adding links in the same style as <code>{{<span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Lts/ (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6THRzLz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">lts/</span>}}</code> and <code>{{<span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Tlrow (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6VGxyb3c/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">tlrow</span>}}</code>. See above for an example what it does.\n</p><p>Use <code>{{<a href=\"/wiki/Template:Tetl\" title=\"Template:Tetl\">tetl</a>}}</code> for the version without <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Template_substitution\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Template substitution\">subst</a><code>:</code>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both\">\n</div></div><table id=\"documentation-meta-data\" class=\"plainlinks fmbox fmbox-system\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background-color: #ecfcf4\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"mbox-text\" style=\"font-style: italic\">Editors can experiment in this template's sandbox <small style=\"font-style: normal;\">(<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://second-renaissance.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Tsetl/sandbox?action=edit&amp;preload=Template%3ADocumentation%2Fpreload-sandbox\">create</a> &#124; <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://second-renaissance.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Tsetl/sandbox?preload=Template%3ATsetl&amp;action=edit&amp;summary=Create+sandbox+version+of+%5B%5BTemplate%3ATsetl%5D%5D\">mirror</a>)</small> and testcases <small style=\"font-style: normal;\">(<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://second-renaissance.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Tsetl/testcases?action=edit&amp;preload=Template%3ADocumentation%2Fpreload-testcases\">create</a>)</small> pages.<br /> <a href=\"/wiki/Special:PrefixIndex/Template:Tsetl/\" title=\"Special:PrefixIndex/Template:Tsetl/\">Subpages of this template</a>.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205412\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.047 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.078 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 212/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6136/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 52/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 6/100\nExpensive parser function count: 5/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 16/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.019/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 894127/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   56.084      1 Template:Doc\n100.00%   56.084      1 -total\n  4.79%    2.688      4 Template:Tlx\n  2.80%    1.569      1 Template:Lts\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:190-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261119205412 and revision id 248. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
